							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							and BTW for your timeline...some Forsaken dates that I can remember off my head.<br /><br /><br />April 14th 2003--Forsaken kills Emp<br /><br />August 14th 2003 &nbsp;First RZ kill<br /><br />Dec 4th First Xeg kill<br /><br />3/1/04- Forsaken kills Coirnav<br /><br />3/8/04- Forsaken kills Rathe<br /><br />and its 5/2 we broke up not 5/3 not that it matters much <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br /><br />Errlano
