	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7692"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=593" title="View the profile of Cataclysm">Cataclysm</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 6<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=593"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:xcatax@bellsouth.net"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7692#msg7692"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7692#msg7692">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #20 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 02:20:44 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was notified of this thread by my brother. I&#039;ll attempt to add whatever I remember to it, although it&#039;ll still leave a lot of gaps. Most of my information deals with the early stages since I&#039;m long gone from EQ. Some of these are 100% accurate, some aren&#039;t, but unless someone else can come up with more accurate &#039;proof&#039; than my screenshots it&#039;s probably the best that can be done for now...<br /><br />For Covenant of Peace, I believe Mirax was an influential member, he might&#039;ve been leader as I was told to talk to either him or Axine at one point about joining.<br /><br />Harbinger of Storms was formed after Avatars of Discord. I was around and was asked to join them after I had already sent in an application to AoD. <br /><br />The key members of early AoD was Satao (guildleader), Axine (recruit), Dyvim (raid), Morghul, Malsheen, Asian, Kimmy, Lofwyr, Nails(?), Armanthus, Ailennin, and hmm - several others. Bartox joined about a week before I did, and Difa afterwards, so they weren&#039;t quite key members back when it was first created.<br /><br />Hmm... Eastern Keep was formed after Harbinger of Storms, AoD, and Thelyn Amar. I was asked to help create that guild.<br /><br />You could include Sinclaire&#039;s obtaining the first Soulfire on the server since it was a big deal back in the day. That was accomplished around June of 1999.<br /><br />The exact date of the first Vox slaying is October 16, 1999. I have screenshots from that event with that date.<br /><br />The exact date of the first Innoruuk slaying is December 18, 1999. They killed him after I had to log off because it was 3am and I had school the next day. Damnit.<br /><br />Sern was &nbsp;a leading figure along with Valdraug and Gazloy in HoS. I know he was an officer and eventually became leader.<br /><br />Fiery Avenger -- As I recall, Aegeis from AoD was the first to accomplish this task (April 2, 2000), Odiny second, and Patryn third. I MAY be incorrect, but in any case, I&#039;m 90% sure that Patryn was also an AL member, not AoD. I was actually not there for Patryn to get his, so I don&#039;t remember.<br /><br />Kunark--<br /><br />Dyvim pretty much faded away for good. He visited from time to time, but never really came back for a long period of time. AoD was pretty screwed by the release of Kunark and morale was extremely low.<br /><br />Random--<br /><br />June 1, 2001 was SK BotB.<br /><br />Yelinak was killed on Dec. 20, 2000. I believe. Have screenshots.<br /><br />Zlandicar seems to be Feb. 17, 2001. Again, screenshots.<br /><br />Revamped Cazic Thule killed on March 14, 2001. (not 100% sure, but screenshots again.)<br /><br />Vulak`Aerr (for AoD at least) September 3, 2001.<br /><br />The Plane of Air thing with Mythmakers etc. was September 9 and 10 of 2000...<br /><br />There&#039;s a Trakanon kill on November 19, 2000 for me, don&#039;t know if that&#039;s the earliest though.<br /><br />I&#039;m guessing the Tunare raid was on May 6, 2001 from screenshots.<br /><br />There&#039;s a Statue of Rallos Zek screenshot I have from May 27, 2001.<br /><br />Sleeper awakened on October 14, 2001...<br /><br />I was the first SK Epic and BotB winner, yes, now remove the question marks. :D<br /><br />First test of tactics:<br />Dyvim, Blyte, Bagbokk, Difa, Tekman, Sethric, Valfarre.<br /><br />Third test of tactics:<br />Ugh. Had this saved somewhere, now can&#039;t find it. Sorry.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
