							lol &lt;Pirates of Velious&gt; maybe this guild returns when they do PvP changes ;)<br /><br />Thanks for posting this, it was very amusing to read, but why posting now? I hope EQ will not loose too many players in near future, it still is a great game with lots of potential, it is too early to post a history! EQ isn&#039;t history yet!<br /><br />--Zorx<br /><br />
