							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Fot and Forsaken both beat Arirang to the Xegony first kill.<br /><br />FoT was September 30th<br /><br />Oct14th or there about was the RoS Split with Conviction formed at about the same time.<br /><br />Dec. 2nd was Hegemony&#039;s FK on Rallos Zek<br /><br />Dec 4th was Forsaken&#039;s Xegony FK.<br /><br />I&#039;ll weed through and get some other dates of interest.
