							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was on sullon zek at the time, but I&#039;ve posted to Arctos&#039; and hegemony&#039;s boards about the alliance between arctos and Highland clan that eventually lead to the creation of Hegemony and few other guilds.<br /><br />so until they post i give you: <a href="http://user.tninet.se/~prv247p/hatt/hatten.swf" target="_blank">http://user.tninet.se/~prv247p/hatt/hatten.swf</a>
						</td>
