							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">Oct14th or there about was the RoS Split with Conviction formed at about the same time.<br /></div><br />I think Diss already mentioned it but here it is again. The RoS split happened Oct 3, 2003, with Conv forming on the 6th. I know this to be true because I left RoS on the 6th and applied to FoT on the 9th &nbsp;;) &nbsp;heh<br /><br />cheers <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />edit: added quote
