							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Need some Highland Clan dates, unfortunatley I think my screenshots from that era are lost from HD wipe..<br /><br />Highland Clan though (Led by Snakes-Leader, and officers: Betchawa, Auspix(who quit + gave account to rl friend and account changed to Aussie).. and other officers that I can&#039;t remember... Thun, Lighting, Kasket, Ssid, myself, Gtex, Cloudskipper, Rogosh, Dakthur, Whitephoenix etc were apart of guild too.. &nbsp;HC split up and everyone went to either Ascent, Forsaken (spawned), and some other guild.. <br /><br />Our top kills was WW dragons + Rogue Epic Completion.. HC FOR LIFE!<br /><br />The guild split a little after Kasket left (L57) and joined Ascent -- think 1 1/2 weeks later.. 
