	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg7706"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393" title="View the profile of Zerxes">Zerxes</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 47<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=393"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7706#msg7706"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=813.msg7706#msg7706">Re:History of Rodcet Nife  [read and add to it]</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #29 on:</b> May 05, 2004, 12:09:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							If you are working on the genealogy of today&#039;s &quot;big players&quot; Del, you should probably have some mention of The Guardians of the Malt. &nbsp;Unfortunately, I&#039;m not much help with dates &nbsp;:(<br /><br />I believe (but am not 100% certain) that Dajal was the first guild leader, but the only other officer I can remember was Chaffee, who later became guild leader when the guild was starting to decline.<br /><br />Notable members: &nbsp;Fornza, Doraf, Plaktu, Pantha, Hairen, Vison, Pyrrho (sp?) - I&#039;m sure I&#039;ve missed a ton.<br /><br />Shortly after the release of Velious (a few months?), GoTM broke up, and of course a new guild was formed - Valde Amicitia, with Fornza (I believe) as guild leader, and I believe Pantha was another officer (not sure about Doraf or other officers).<br /><br />Valde Amicitia picked up ex-AoD players, later became Anthology . . . now we have Fires of Time.<br /><br />I&#039;m sure some ex-Malters can confirm some of the things above, and give some dates and provide more officer names.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
